# Content pins for scripts/checks/triad-baseline-exempt.txt — PROJECT-OWNED.
# Consumed via TRIAD_BASELINE_HASH_FILE. Format: <sha256>  <repo-relative-path>
#
# A baseline entry with no matching pin here is NEVER honoured, and a pin that no longer
# matches the file's live bytes forfeits the exemption — enforcement re-arms for that path.
# That is the mechanism working as intended: an edited contract must re-earn its exemption.
